WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.707
Today each sentence has two pictures. Only one of them fits.

2
00:00:04.157 --> 00:00:06.736
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.236 --> 00:00:09.351
Your child reads the sentence out loud.

4
00:00:09.751 --> 00:00:11.179
The cat is on the box.

5
00:00:11.879 --> 00:00:18.832
Both pictures show a cat and a box. In one, the cat is on the box. In the other, the box is on the cat.

6
00:00:19.282 --> 00:00:22.298
Ask: which picture shows it? Your child circles it.

7
00:00:22.748 --> 00:00:27.087
Then ask what is wrong in the other one. That is where the understanding shows.

8
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:33.380
The same words, in the same sentence, are in both pictures. Only the meaning tells them apart.

9
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.597
Some of today's sentences turn on one small word. Like this one.

10
00:00:37.997 --> 00:00:39.297
The pig has no hat.

11
00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:46.239
For job two, press play on the sound track and step away. The voice waits, then reads each sentence.

12
00:00:46.689 --> 00:00:52.659
Your child marks the box under each sentence. Then goes back, and circles the picture that fits.

13
00:00:53.109 --> 00:00:57.358
At the end, your child shows you the circles, and reads one sentence to you.
